OL,3,GNEWSADaniel Thomas jailed for 15 months
OL,4,Afor slashing dinghy
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-migrant activist Daniel Thomas has
OL,7,Fbeen jailed for 15 months for slashing
OL,8,Fa dinghy with a knife in the English
OL,9,FChannel.
OL,11,FThe 37-year-old, known to his
OL,12,Fsupporters as Danny Tommo,
OL,13,Flive-streamed himself cutting the boat
OL,14,Fwhile a French rescue worker was on
OL,15,Fboard in September.
OL,17,FSentencing him, a judge called Thomas a
OL,18,F"publicity seeker" whose actions were a
OL,19,F"flagrant interference" with the work
OL,20,Fof rescue crews.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
